<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:lang="lzh"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>瘋疾潛來雪梨</title><title type="alternate">Feng ji qian lai Xueli [A Chinese Man Reported Travelling to Sydney]</title><author>無署名（《東華報》）</author><respStmt><resp>整理與編碼</resp><name>曲宸宇 (Chu, Chen-Yu)</name></respStmt></titleStmt><editionStmt><edition>Transcription dataset v0.2.0</edition></editionStmt><publicationStmt><p>曲宸宇 (Chu, Chen-Yu). Dataset edition 0.2.0.</p></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><bibl><title>東華報</title><date when="1925-11-28">1925-11-28</date><idno>Tung Wah Times, 1925-11-28, p. 7, NLA news-page24101368</idno><ref target="https://trove.nla.gov.au/newspaper/page/24101368">澳洲國家圖書館 Trove</ref></bibl></sourceDesc></fileDesc></teiHeader><facsimile><surface n="7" xml:id="original-page"><graphic url="https://trove.nla.gov.au/ndp/imageservice/nla.news-page24101368/level5" /></surface></facsimile><text><body><div type="article"><pb n="7" facs="#original-page" /><head>瘋疾潛來雪梨</head><p><lb n="single-1" />十一月二十號。。本省加立頓埠消息<lb n="single-2" />云。。有一華人在馬克邁埠居住。。已<lb n="single-3" />歷十八圓月。。近有患瘋疾之嫌疑。。<lb n="single-4" />乃於昨日乘舟來加立頓。。轉搭火車<lb n="single-5" />往雪梨。。該埠警察。。事後頗久。。始<lb n="single-6" />悉其事。。未能於該車未抵步之前。。<lb n="single-7" />通告雪梨當道檢拿云。。</p></div></body></text></TEI>